  "h_design_body": "i used Microsoft PowerPoint to design a layout for the website, I also used a notebook to design a character to 3d model to show my process\nwhile using PowerPoint i experimented with the colours to find colours that looked good together i used html color codes to find complementary colours for some pastel yellows until i found the colour pallet i liked the most\nand i found some fonts that help with the feel of my website i found the fonts via google fonts\ni used space grotesk which a round font for all my smaller text which too me evokes feelings of old education websites\ni also used Bevan for headers and titles its sharper shapes compaired to space grotesk makes it stick out a little but not too much ",
