  "h_reflect_body": "it teaches the basics of what is needed for all sections being, modeling, texturing and rigging if the reader is still needing help they can always go to the external trusted creators if they need more help, the site should be used as a jumping off point not the one and only resource someone should use. \nthe background colours and fonts were all chosen to evoke the feeling of education websites to create a friendly and welcoming environment. the colours are pastel so they are not dim or overly colourful to not distract from the learning experience. the fonts are subtitle with the differences with the title font being sharper and more bold while the text font is softer and had less width to it i also made the background colourful to make the screenshots sickout a bit more then if it was white or black background.",
